 blood and tears until there's nothing left. Just to wake up the day after and find them intact. Ground all day upon a stretching rack. I wonder if I'll ever be able to perish all the way. Grip the seams until the point where the limbs cannot find their own back to me. Cut out my tongue and scorch my lungs and permeate the feedback loop of anger and confusion."}, {"start": "01:29:51", "end": "01:30:35", "text": "Sometimes I feel like I'm drowning, drowning on my own two feet, just pain throughout the city that rains a thousand weeks, pain throughout the city that rains a thousand weeks, big and semi-broken, they send me even deeper."}, {"start": "01:30:44", "end": "01:31:14", "text": ""}], "fbi_json": [{"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:21:00"}, "track": {"title": "As The Deer", "artists": [{"name": "Fleiva Music & Grace Idowu"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:22:00"}, "track": {"title": "Feel the Vibe (Mixed)", "artists": [{"name": "Axwell"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}, {"timestamp": {"enabled": true, "formatted": "01:59:00"}, "track": {"title": "I Need Your Love (feat. Ellie Goulding)", "artists": [{"name": "Calvin Harris"}]}, "isPremiere": false, "_confidence": "low"}]}